loat 数据按 16 位 `bfloat16_t` 解析，产生精度损失。修复通过 `if constexpr` 在编译期对 `bfloat16_t` 特化：标量指针直接转换为 `float*` 读取，其他类型保持原有逻辑不变。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **bf16 标量读取类型特化**: 在 `ForeachAddcdivScalarSimtKernel` 函数中，对 `bfloat16_t` 类型新增编译期分支，将 `scalar` 指针强制转换为 `float*` 而非 `T*` 来读取标量值，确保正确读取 FP32 存储的 bf16 标量数据。\n- **通用类型路径保留**: 对于非 bf16 类型（FP16、FP32），标量读取逻辑保持原样，仍通过 `static_cast<float>` 将 `T*` 指向的值转为 float，不影响现有行为。\n- **注释补充**: 新增注释说明 `DtypeScalarToTensor2` 规则下不同精度类型标量的实际存储格式（FP16→FP16, FP32→FP32, BF16→FP32），为后续维护提供上下文。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-03T11:55:46+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-03T11:55:46+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178406842,"discussion_id":"b914d6bdc1d0640c2efc21d8ac35410e3f3fe521","body":"/reject","created_at":"2026-07-03T12:01:29+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-03T12:01:29+08:00","user":{"id":"6863449ca39ca35309897c87","login":"lileizheng","object_id":"6863449ca39ca35309897c87","name":"lileizheng","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/lileizheng"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178406946,"discussion_id":"d043bf0c8afda35579a1a72cfebb443b4a50caac","body":"<table><caption>pipeline history</caption><tr><th>Time</th><th>Name</th><th>Result</th><th>Link</th></tr><tr><td>2026-07-03 11:58:06</td><td>Start_Pipeline</td><td></td><td><a href=\"https://codehub-y.huawei.com/Conv2D_CI/ops-nn/merge_requests/298?sourceProjectId=101818307\" title=\"MR_298\">MR_298</a></td></tr></table>","created_at":"2026-07-03T12:01:51+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-03T12:01:51+08:00","user":{"id":"69003700f08b414829576c64","login":"conv2d_ci","object_id":"69003700f08b414829576c64","name":"conv2d_ci","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/conv2d_ci"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178407069,"discussion_id":"29524b1e96191c668716e768f3eeb4f1d4c8c039","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n我已经完整审查了该 diff 文件及其上下文。让我总结我的分析：\n\n## 变更分析\n\n### 变更目的\n修复 `foreach_addcdiv_scalar` 算子在 **bfloat16_t** 类型下的双标杆精度问题（Issue #3666）。\n\n### 变更内容\n在 `ForeachAddcdivScalarSimtKernel` 中，当模板参数 `T` 为 `bfloat16_t` 时，将标量读取方式从 `reinterpret_cast<__gm__ bfloat16_t*>(scalar)` + `static_cast<float>` 改为 `reinterpret_cast<__gm__ float*>(scalar)` + 直接读取。\n\n### 正确性验证\n\n1. **`DtypeScalarToTensor2` 映射规则**（定义在 `foreach_proto_utils.h`）：\n   - `DT_FLOAT16` → `DT_FLOAT16`（FP16 标量保持 FP16）\n   - `DT_FLOAT` → `DT_FLOAT`（FP32 标量保持 FP32）\n   - `DT_BF16` → `DT_FLOAT`（BF16 **标量提升为 FP32**）\n\n2. **ACLNN API 层**（`aclnn_foreach_addcdiv_scalar_v2.cpp` 第 209-213 行）显式处理：当数据类型为 BF16 时，`ConvertToTensor(scalar, DataType::DT_FLOAT)` —— 标量张量确实以 FP32 存储。\n\n3. **旧代码的 Bug**：旧代码对 `T=bfloat16_t` 时，将 4 字节 FP32 标量 reinterpret_cast 为 `bfloat16_t*`，只读取了前 2 字节，导致标量值完全错误（精度问题）。\n\n4. **新代码的修复**：正确地将 4 字节 FP32 标量作为 `float` 读取。其他类型路径（`half`、`float`）保持不变，行为与原代码一致。\n\n### 结论\n该修复逻辑正确，对标量存储格式的理解与框架层面 `DtypeScalarToTensor2` 的约定一致，不存在正确性、安全性或可靠性问题。\n\n---\n\n## 审查结论\n\n**审查文件：**\n- `foreach/foreach_addcdiv_scalar/op_kernel/arch35/foreach_addcdiv_scalar_simt.h` — **无问题**\n\n**发现统计：**\n- P0: 0\n- P1: 0\n- P2: 0\n- P3: 0\n\n**总体风险判断：低**。该变更是一个精准的定点修复，仅针对 BF16 类型的标量读取路径，将错误的 2 字节读取改为正确的 4 字节 FP32 读取，与框架的 `DtypeScalarToTensor2` 约定一致。`if constexpr` 在编译期展开，无运行时开销。其他 dtype 路径（half、float）行为完全不变。未发现由此变更引入的任何缺陷。\n\n> ⚠️ 已识别出整体风险，但无法提取行内评论，请参考整体评估。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-03T12:02:19+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-03T12:02:19+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178452419,"discussion_id":"f11ad8759c32ec3b3c6b699efc91d40c234e8542","body":"[@zhou-qilong](https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong)\n","created_at":"2026-07-03T15:56:09+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-03T15:56:09+08:00","user":{"id":"68cd01234603fb12c4661b29","login":"zhouxuan78","object_id":"68cd01234603fb12c4661b29","name":"zhouxuan78","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhouxuan78"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178479781,"discussion_id":"fe7dad9618885f9712f31858d43b3d26304cf6bb","body":"/lgtm\n/approve","created_at":"2026-07-03T17:17:28+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-03T17:17:28+08:00","user":{"id":"68776ee7fc42115893ad8ad9","login":"wang-xing001","object_id":"68776ee7fc42115893ad8ad9","name":"wang-xing001","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wang-xing001"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178537977,"discussion_id":"583f8c6aeb79a06f4263b8e660e82ab89bfffc92","body":"/lgtm\n/approve","created_at":"2026-07-04T10:56:16+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-04T10:56:16+08:00","user":{"id":"6822d32a6a68fa1fec6cc84b","login":"su-yueming","object_id":"6822d32a6a68fa1fec6cc84b","name":"su-yueming","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/su-yueming"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"}]